# A row's badges all sit on its repo line, before the owner, coloured as the tabs' statuses are.
wait settled
expect button ~"gazette #272, Approved, tamarinworks,"
expect button ~"gazette #273, Draft, on #272, tamarinworks,"
expect button ~"lily #1325, Review required, tamarinworks,"
snap list-badges-dark
appearance light
snap list-badges-light
